+/* The unwind mode's loop: one thread, its handle kept open, and the interval
+ * from a high-resolution timer with random jitter (0.5-1.5 x the period).
+ * The general loop sleeps with Sleep(), which wakes on the 15.6 ms scheduler
+ * tick and also snapshots every thread each time: ~20 samples a second, in
+ * step with the tick, and a thread whose waits also end on the tick was then
+ * caught waiting far more often than it waits (HighGraphics read as 60% in
+ * sys_semaphore_wait; SEM_PROF in the same run measured 3-6%). */
